About This Work

This project represents the exploration and implementation of modern
digital experiences, focusing on:

• Frontend Engineering
  React, Next.js, Vue, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Modern Component Architecture

• UI/UX Design & Engineering
  User Flow, Wireframe, Design Systems, Interactive Prototyping (Figma)

• IT & System Support
  Windows, Linux, Networking, Troubleshooting, System Maintenance

• Technical Writing
  Developer Guides, Documentation, GitBook, Technical Articles

• Emerging Technologies & Modern Web
  Artificial Intelligence (LLMs / Agents), Web3, Scalable Architecture


Built with curiosity, creativity, and continuous improvement.

